OL,3,GNEWSAOriginal artwork by Turner on
OL,4,Adisplay at dockyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FOriginal works by JMW Turner are on
OL,7,Fdisplay at the Historic Dockyard
OL,8,FChatham, offering visitors a rare
OL,9,Fglimpse into the artist's connection
OL,10,Fwith the River Medway.
OL,12,FThe exhibition includes Turner's Medway
OL,13,Fsketchbook and his second sketch for
OL,14,FThe Battle of Trafalgar, on loan from
OL,15,FTate.
OL,17,FOrganisers said the artist was
OL,18,Ffascinated by Chatham and visited the
OL,19,Fdockyard to sketch the site where HMS
OL,20,FVictory and HMS Temeraire were built.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
