OL,3,GNEWSAOriginal artwork by Turner on
OL,4,Adisplay at dockyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Ball, collections, galleries and
OL,7,Finterpretation manager of the trust,
OL,8,Fsaid they were "excited" to have
OL,9,Fcurated this exhibition, alongside the
OL,10,Fworks of contemporary artist, Jake
OL,11,FWood-Evans.
